  "changelog": "Building support: the Building Editor's Detail Edit handoffs now open the building itself \u2014 its footprint as a ring under the rectangle law (drag a corner to resize, edge points move whole edges, Shift+drag lasso and Resegment along the outline, corners protected). Saves write only that building's record in the zone's buildings.json (+ buildings.js twin), after re-verifying the record still matches the building that was sent. Carries 1.2.2's handoff honesty: unknown payloads are preserved aside and spoken, never silently discarded.",
